  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.79,
      "end_seconds": 7.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "text": "Erm, doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.05,
      "end_seconds": 12.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.19,
      "end_seconds": 25.25,
      "duration_seconds": 11.06,
      "text": "Okay, so mainly pain on the outside of my elbow. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.63,
      "end_seconds": 29.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.38,
      "end_seconds": 45.35,
      "duration_seconds": 13.97,
      "text": "erm, honestly I can't say exactly when it started. It might have been last month or the month before, I really can't pin it down"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.63,
      "end_seconds": 48.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "How frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.25,
      "end_seconds": 52.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "It happens once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.57,
      "end_seconds": 56.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Has there been a weaker grip too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.94,
      "end_seconds": 63.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Yes, you know, actually."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.63,
      "end_seconds": 67.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "have you noticed numbness, swelling or neck pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.37,
      "end_seconds": 74.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, no, no numbness, swelling or neck pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.33,
      "end_seconds": 81.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Any pins and and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.04,
      "end_seconds": 84.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.88,
      "end_seconds": 88.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.69,
      "end_seconds": 109.33,
      "duration_seconds": 19.64,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner. I have about eight cigarettes in a day. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. I live with my elderly mother. I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.56,
      "end_seconds": 120.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.44,
      "end_seconds": 132.28,
      "duration_seconds": 9.84,
      "text": "Yes, diclofenac. I've no idea what the reaction was, only that I'm not supposed to have it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.75,
      "end_seconds": 141.55,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "what do you take on a normal day? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.41,
      "end_seconds": 145.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "it's simvastatin, at night for my cholesterol"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.23,
      "end_seconds": 149.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "right, how much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.65,
      "end_seconds": 155.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "20 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.1,
      "end_seconds": 159.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.08,
      "end_seconds": 163.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "High cholesterol, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.83,
      "end_seconds": 174.55,
      "duration_seconds": 8.72,
      "text": "Okay, I can see high cholesterol in your file as well. What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.53,
      "end_seconds": 179.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "my daughter has type 1 diabetes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.99,
      "end_seconds": 183.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "what operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.53,
      "end_seconds": 190.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "Hmm, yes, I had part of my thyroid removed, years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.35,
      "end_seconds": 194.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.2,
      "end_seconds": 209.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.22,
      "end_seconds": 243.27,
      "duration_seconds": 15.05,
      "text": "okay: weight 56 kilos, heart rate 79, blood pressure 113 over 75, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, height 167 centimetres, BMI works out to to 20.1, temp 36.8 degrees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.16,
      "end_seconds": 262.33,
      "duration_seconds": 6.17,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression from what you've said is this: This is probably tennis elbow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.21,
      "end_seconds": 266.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.97,
      "end_seconds": 286.9,
      "duration_seconds": 19.93,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's tennis elbow, and we'll watch how it goes. Let me repeat that back to make sure. You've had pain on the outside of your elbow, and no neck pain or numbness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.84,
      "end_seconds": 292.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "yes, uh, you've got it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.54,
      "end_seconds": 321.26,
      "duration_seconds": 26.72,
      "text": "rest it, use a forearm strap and do the stretches I'll show you try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse i'll want another look if it is not better in six weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.03,
      "end_seconds": 326.73,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.28,
      "end_seconds": 330.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.31,
      "end_seconds": 334.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.92,
      "end_seconds": 339.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "take care now"
    }
  ]
}